:true,\"body\":\"<p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\"><span>How to Obtain Free Duolingo Super Subscriptions via Airtel and Lidl Plus</span></span></p><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span>This document outlines two legitimate methods to obtain complimentary Duolingo Super subscriptions. The first option is available to Airtel users in India, while the second is accessible to users worldwide through the Lidl Plus application.</span></p><hr><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\"><span>Option 1: Airtel Users – 12 Months of Duolingo Super</span></span></p><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span>Airtel is offering a 12-month Duolingo Super subscription at no cost to its active customers. This offer is valid for claims made from September 3, 2026, to December 2, 2026. The standard value of this subscription is approximately 3,120 Indian Rupees.</span></p><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span>This benefit is available to all active Airtel lines, including prepaid, postpaid, Wi-Fi, and DTH connections.</span></p><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\"><span>Procedure:</span></span></p><ol><li><p><span>Open the Airtel Thanks application on your device.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Navigate to the Rewards and OTTs section, or look for the Claim OTTs and More option. Locate the Airtel Insider shelf.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Find and tap on the Super Duolingo – 12 Months FREE card.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Tap the Claim Now button, then select Proceed.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Log in to your existing Duolingo account or register for a new one. The Super subscription will be activated immediately.</span></p></li></ol><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\"><span>Important Notes:</span></span></p><ul><li><p><span>The subscription validity begins on the day you claim the offer and ends after 12 months.</span></p></li><li><p><span>The subscription does not auto-renew. This is confirmed in Airtel&#x27;s official FAQ documentation.</span></p></li><li><p><span>No payment card is required for this offer.</span></p></li></ul><hr><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\"><span>Option 2: Lidl Plus – 2 Months of Duolingo Super (Available Worldwide)</span></span></p><p style=\\\"color:rgb(249, 250, 251);font-size:16px\\\"><span>Lidl Plus is offering a promotional code for a two-month Duolingo Super subscription. This offer is available to users in any country. The code must be obtained by September 13, 2026, and redeemed ", "ts": 1788702071004}, {"method": "GET", "url": "/api/market/summary", "req_headers": null, "req_body": null, "status": 200, "resp_body": "{\"ok\":true,\"items\":[{\"sym\":\"BTC\",\"price\":79826.0,\"chg\":0.10607,\"spark\":[79713.129978018,79617.56064482199,79730.88136501185,79803.39493926977,80053.61256468344,80045.27884672082,79987.72340498707,79757.93033702066,79741.22436343327,79909.49573147147,79781.05895269189,79821.69873179746,79886.77458177783,79959.30436655713,79906.5630995094,80026.31967167041,79862.90595561713,79971.37099232111,79772.81701990326,79811.52488960416,79835.09901045753,79878.78090091703,80001.87569426838,79911.77981667651]},{\"sym\":\"ETH\",\"price\":2492.76,\"chg\":1.333,\"spark\":[2459.027552275698,2453.8953798544057,2457.4912209236654,2459.809287535746,2471.0734314624283,2480.4278596113386,2480.137035008244,2477.7542870615234,2477.3964938884806,2489.0376060852186,2480.989497005367,2480.0031686031184,2490.5378743797933,2506.409830287171,2503.424029567272,2509.4091463944146,2504.131380806759,2512.856734977631,2505.8308191159745,2496.8135797878,2495.5084732822006,2498.9195132447553,2501.507783741625,2501.5579051044356]},{\"sym\":\"BNB\",\"price\":751.36,\"chg\":-1.874